    <string name="tour_home_welcome_title">Welcome to TSched</string>
    <string name="tour_home_welcome_body">TSched is a weekly schedule. It shows the days of a repeating week, Sunday to Saturday, not calendar dates.\n\nThis quick tour lights up the things you will use. Tap Next to go on, or Skip to leave.</string>
    <string name="tour_home_days_title">Your Week</string>
    <string name="tour_home_days_body">Each card is a day. Swipe left or right to move between days. Turn your phone sideways to see the whole week at once.</string>
    <string name="tour_home_add_title">Add Event</string>
    <string name="tour_home_add_body">Tap here to put something on your week. In a moment we will look at the form it opens.</string>
    <string name="tour_home_free_title">Unplaced Free Events</string>
    <string name="tour_home_free_body">Free events do not have a time yet. They wait here until you place them: open this, tap Place Events, and TSched suggests times around your fixed events. The number is how many are waiting.</string>
    <string name="tour_home_filter_title">Filter</string>
    <string name="tour_home_filter_body">Show only one color of event, such as just school or just work. Double-tap it to clear the filter. In its popup, tap Edit Names to rename colors.</string>
    <string name="tour_home_snap_title">Snap to Day</string>
    <string name="tour_home_snap_body">Jump straight to any day. Double-tap it to jump to today.</string>
    <string name="tour_home_settings_title">Settings</string>
    <string name="tour_home_settings_body">This is where all the general settings are. For example, you can choose when each day’s view starts, turn vibration and sound on, delete many events at once, or replay this tour.</string>
    <string name="tour_home_events_title">Your Events</string>
    <string name="tour_home_events_body">Tap any event to see its details, edit it, or delete it. Deleting always asks you first. An event that repeats on several days is edited and deleted on all of its days together.</string>
    <string name="tour_add_kind_title">Pick the Type</string>
    <string name="tour_add_kind_body">Fixed happens at a set time, like a class or a shift.\n\nFree needs time somewhere, like studying. You give it a length and TSched finds a spot.\n\nCounted is fixed, but it counts down, like 10 more lectures, and goes away at zero.</string>
    <string name="tour_add_name_title">Name it</string>
    <string name="tour_add_name_body">Every event needs a name. The location under it is optional.</string>
    <string name="tour_add_color_title">Choose a Color</string>
    <string name="tour_add_color_body">Colors help you tell events apart, and you can filter the calendar by color. Tap this and turn the wheel to pick one.</string>
    <string name="tour_add_days_title">Pick the Days</string>
    <string name="tour_add_days_body">Tap each day it happens on. Choose several to make one event on every one of those days; they are edited and deleted together.</string>
    <string name="tour_add_times_title">Set the Times</string>
    <string name="tour_add_times_body">Fixed and Counted events need a start and an end time. Tap each button to open a clock. Free events ask for a length instead.</string>
    <string name="tour_add_save_title">Save it</string>
    <string name="tour_add_save_body">Tap Save Event to put it on your calendar. Nothing is saved during this tour. Tap Done to go back to the calendar.</string>
